{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>56歲性感女神鍾麗緹昨日驚喜帶著16歲細女Cayla現身香港出席公開活動，母女同框的高顏值畫面瞬間引爆全城熱話 …</p><p></p>\n<p>56歲性感女神鍾麗緹昨日驚喜帶著16歲細女Cayla現身香港出席公開活動，母女同框的高顏值畫面瞬間引爆全城熱話。隨著Cayla暴風式長大兼出落得亭亭玉立，傳媒紛紛將焦點放在她的感情狀況！</p>\n<h2>女神帶愛女流利廣東話接受訪問</h2>\n<p>鍾麗緹近年主力北上發展並甚少在香港公開露面，昨日她突然帶著16歲小女兒Cayla重返香港出席大型活動。鍾麗緹依然保養得宜，與充滿青春氣息愛女站在一起猶如兩姊妹。令人驚喜是她受訪時全程以極度流利廣東話對答，完全沒有生疏退步，瞬間拉近與現場觀眾距離。</p>\n<h2>開明媽咪爆愛女Cayla避搭訕絕情奇招</h2>\n<p>擁有立體精緻五官兼高挑身材Cayla自然吸引大量狂蜂浪蝶，被問及會否擔心愛女太早拍拖時，鍾麗緹表現得超級豁達並大方回應指：「佢已經16歲啦，有自己嘅想法，感情嘅嘢係控制唔到嘅，最緊要佢開心同識得保護自己！」至於一直站在身旁保持高冷氣場Cayla亦即席示範其防範陌生人搭訕絕技，當被問及遇上陌生人埋身時如何處理，她一秒切換至極度冷漠眼神，並馬上轉身頭也不回離開現場，自我保護意識極度強烈。</p>\n<h2>完美繼承母親強大基因 獲封為最美星二代</h2>\n<p>其實Cayla自小已經備受外界高度關注，小時候曾跟隨繼父參與內地親子真人騷節目，當時憑藉精靈可愛模樣成功俘虜無數觀眾歡心。如今她已經迎來16歲花樣年華，外貌輪廓越來越分明，不但遺傳母親獨特混血氣質，更擁有一雙標誌性大眼睛及逆天長腿。隨著她頻繁在各大社交平台及活動亮相，其超高顏值及模特兒般身段令她人氣持續急升，在眾多圈中星二代之中脫穎而出。</p>\n<h2>網民比較：大方得體過沈月</h2>\n<p>大批網民紛紛被Cayla驚人美貌徹底迷倒，有網民直指「呢個就真係最靚嘅星二代啦」，甚至有人將她與其他知名星二代作比較，留言稱讚她「大方得體過沈月」、「好睇過沈月，但有少少國內feel」。不過亦有部分嚴格網民認為母親當年魅力實在太過強大，坦言Cayla「不及媽媽年輕時咁卓越」、「不及呀媽後生時的特別出眾」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328478284945443_11751077916ae35aaf4065c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328478284945443_11751077916ae35aaf4065c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>56歲性感女神鍾麗緹昨日驚喜帶著16歲細女Cayla現身香港出席公開活動。（圖片來源：Viu1HK）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932847846622638_5979459106ae35ab0d3ba4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932847846622638_5979459106ae35ab0d3ba4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>母女同框的高顏值畫面瞬間引爆全城熱話。（圖片來源：Viu1HK）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328478675276780_21405315456ae35ab308b92.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-4\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328478675276780_21405315456ae35ab308b92.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>隨著Cayla暴風式長大兼出落得亭亭玉立，傳媒紛紛將焦點放在她的感情狀況！（圖片來源：Viu1HK）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328478858222328_15848910016ae35ab4be409.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328478858222328_15848910016ae35ab4be409.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>大批網民紛紛被Cayla驚人美貌徹底迷倒，有網民直指「呢個就真係最靚嘅星二代啦」（圖片來源：IG@caylajyn_6）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328479025238895_12837404466ae35ab66f28d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179328479025238895_12837404466ae35ab66f28d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@caylajyn_6）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/cayla/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cayla</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%98%9f%e4%ba%8c%e4%bb%a3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">星二代</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%8d%be%e9%ba%97%e7%b7%b9/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鍾麗緹</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3532375\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nOct 29 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T16:21:23.372939+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1392,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T14:39:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T22:38:33.794380+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T16:18:34.757440+00:00","content_hash":"b852b5cb9b094d0b2f54d1507661679eefa3c8ba236c891797790ac79ca32334","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}